\s1 Rahab Welcomes the Spies
\p \v 1 \w Then Joshua|strong="H03091"\w* \w son|strong="H01121"\w* \w of Nun|strong="H05126"\w* \w secretly|strong="H02791"\w* \w sent|strong="H07971"\w* \w two|strong="H08147"\w* \w spies|strong="H07270"\w* \w from|strong="H04480"\w* \w Shittim|strong="H07851"\w*,\f + \fr 2:1 \ft Or \fqa Acacia Grove\f* \w saying|strong="H00559"\w*, “\w Go|strong="H01980"\w*, \w inspect|strong="H07200"\w* \w the land|strong="H00776"\w*, \w especially Jericho|strong="H03405"\w*.” \w So they went|strong="H01980"\w* \w and entered|strong="H00935"\w* \w the house|strong="H01004"\w* \w of a prostitute|strong="H02181"\w* \w named|strong="H08034"\w* \w Rahab|strong="H07343"\w* \w and stayed|strong="H07901"\w* \w there|strong="H08033"\w*.
\p \v 2 \w And it was reported|strong="H00559"\w* \w to the king|strong="H04428"\w* \w of Jericho|strong="H03405"\w*: “\w Behold|strong="H02009"\w*, \w some men|strong="H00582"\w* \w of Israel|strong="H03478"\w* \w have come|strong="H00935"\w* \w here|strong="H02008"\w* \w tonight|strong="H03915"\w* \w to spy out|strong="H02658"\w* \w the land|strong="H00776"\w*.”
\p \v 3 \w So the king|strong="H04428"\w* \w of Jericho|strong="H03405"\w* \w sent|strong="H07971"\w* \w to|strong="H00413"\w* \w Rahab|strong="H07343"\w* \w and said|strong="H00559"\w*, “\w Bring out|strong="H03318"\w* \w the men|strong="H00582"\w* \w who came|strong="H00935"\w* \w to|strong="H00413"\w* \w you|strong="H00834"\w* \w and entered|strong="H00935"\w* \w your house|strong="H01004"\w*, \w for|strong="H03588"\w* \w they have come|strong="H00935"\w* \w to spy out|strong="H02658"\w* \w the whole|strong="H03605"\w* \w land|strong="H00776"\w*.”
\p \v 4 \w But the woman|strong="H00802"\w* \w had taken|strong="H03947"\w* \w the two|strong="H08147"\w* \w men|strong="H00582"\w* \w and hidden them|strong="H06845"\w*. \w So she said|strong="H00559"\w*, “\w Yes|strong="H03651"\w*, \w the men|strong="H00582"\w* \w did come|strong="H00935"\w* \w to me|strong="H00413"\w*, \w but I did not|strong="H03808"\w* \w know|strong="H03045"\w* \w where|strong="H00370"\w* \w they had come from|strong="H01992"\w*. \v 5 \w At dusk|strong="H02822"\w*, \w when the gate|strong="H08179"\w* \w was|strong="H01961"\w* \w about to close|strong="H05462"\w*, \w the men|strong="H00582"\w* \w went out|strong="H03318"\w*, \w and I do not|strong="H03808"\w* \w know|strong="H03045"\w* \w which way|strong="H00575"\w* \w they|strong="H00582"\w* \w went|strong="H01980"\w*. \w Pursue|strong="H07291"\w* \w them|strong="H00310"\w* \w quickly|strong="H04118"\w*, \w and|strong="H03588"\w* \w you may catch them|strong="H05381"\w*!” \v 6 (\w But Rahab|strong="H01931"\w* \w had taken them up|strong="H05927"\w* \w to the roof|strong="H01406"\w* \w and hidden them|strong="H02934"\w* \w among the stalks|strong="H06086"\w* \w of flax|strong="H06593"\w* \w that she had laid out|strong="H06186"\w* \w there|strong="H01406"\w*.)
\p \v 7 \w So the king’s men|strong="H00582"\w* \w set out in pursuit|strong="H07291"\w* \w of the spies|strong="H00310"\w* \w along the road|strong="H01870"\w* \w to|strong="H05921"\w* \w the fords|strong="H04569"\w* \w of the Jordan|strong="H03383"\w*, \w and as|strong="H00834"\w* \w soon as they|strong="H03318"\w* \w had gone out|strong="H07291"\w*, \w the gate|strong="H08179"\w* \w was shut|strong="H05462"\w*.
\s1 The Promise to Rahab
\p \v 8 \w Before|strong="H02962"\w* \w the spies|strong="H01992"\w* \w lay down for the night|strong="H07901"\w*, \w Rahab|strong="H01931"\w* \w went up|strong="H05927"\w* \w on|strong="H05921"\w* \w the roof|strong="H01406"\w* \v 9 \w and said|strong="H00559"\w* \w to them|strong="H00413"\w*, “\w I know|strong="H03045"\w* \w that|strong="H03588"\w* \w the LORD|strong="H03068"\w* \w has given|strong="H05414"\w* you \w this land|strong="H00776"\w* \w and that|strong="H03588"\w* \w the fear of you|strong="H00367"\w* \w has fallen|strong="H05307"\w* \w on us|strong="H05921"\w*, \w so that|strong="H03588"\w* \w all|strong="H03605"\w* \w who dwell|strong="H03427"\w* \w in the land|strong="H00776"\w* \w are melting in fear|strong="H04127"\w* \w of you|strong="H06440"\w*. \v 10 \w For|strong="H03588"\w* \w we have heard|strong="H08085"\w* \w how|strong="H00834"\w* \w the LORD|strong="H03068"\w* \w dried up|strong="H03001"\w* \w the waters|strong="H04325"\w* \w of the Red|strong="H05488"\w* \w Sea|strong="H03220"\w*\f + \fr 2:10 \ft Or \fqa the Sea of Reeds\f* \w before you|strong="H06440"\w* \w when you came out|strong="H03318"\w* \w of Egypt|strong="H04714"\w*, \w and what|strong="H00834"\w* \w you did|strong="H06213"\w* \w to Sihon|strong="H05511"\w* \w and Og|strong="H05747"\w*, \w the two|strong="H08147"\w* \w kings|strong="H04428"\w* \w of the Amorites|strong="H00567"\w* \w across|strong="H05676"\w* \w the Jordan|strong="H03383"\w*, \w whom|strong="H00834"\w* \w you devoted to destruction|strong="H02763"\w*.\f + \fr 2:10 \ft Forms of the Hebrew \fqa cherem \ft refer to the giving over of things or persons to the LORD, either by destroying them or by giving them as an offering.\f* \v 11 \w When we heard this|strong="H08085"\w*, \w our hearts|strong="H03824"\w* \w melted|strong="H04549"\w* \w and everyone’s|strong="H00376"\w* \w courage|strong="H07307"\w* \w failed|strong="H03808"\w* \w because of you|strong="H06440"\w*, \w for|strong="H03588"\w* \w the LORD|strong="H03068"\w* \w your God|strong="H00430"\w* \w is God|strong="H00430"\w* \w in the heavens|strong="H08064"\w* \w above|strong="H04605"\w* \w and on|strong="H05921"\w* \w the earth|strong="H00776"\w* \w below|strong="H08478"\w*.
\p \v 12 \w Now therefore|strong="H06258"\w*, \w please|strong="H04994"\w* \w swear|strong="H07650"\w* to me \w by the LORD|strong="H03068"\w* \w that you|strong="H00859"\w* \w will indeed|strong="H01571"\w* \w show|strong="H06213"\w* \w kindness|strong="H02617"\w* \w to|strong="H05973"\w* \w my family|strong="H01004"\w*, \w because|strong="H03588"\w* \w I showed|strong="H06213"\w* \w kindness|strong="H02617"\w* \w to you|strong="H05973"\w*. \w Give|strong="H05414"\w* me \w a sure|strong="H00571"\w* \w sign|strong="H00226"\w* \v 13 \w that you will spare the lives|strong="H02421"\w* \w of my father|strong="H00001"\w* \w and|strong="H00853"\w* \w mother|strong="H00517"\w*, \w my brothers|strong="H00251"\w* \w and|strong="H00853"\w* \w sisters|strong="H00269"\w*, \w and all|strong="H03605"\w* \w who belong|strong="H00834"\w* to them, \w and that you will deliver|strong="H05337"\w* \w us|strong="H05315"\w* \w from death|strong="H04194"\w*.”
\p \v 14 “\w Our lives|strong="H05315"\w* \w for your|strong="H08478"\w* \w lives|strong="H04191"\w*!” \w the men|strong="H00582"\w* \w agreed|strong="H00559"\w*. “\w If|strong="H00518"\w* \w you do not|strong="H03808"\w* \w report|strong="H05046"\w* \w our mission|strong="H01697"\w*, \w we will show|strong="H06213"\w* \w you|strong="H05973"\w* \w kindness|strong="H02617"\w* \w and faithfulness|strong="H00571"\w* \w when the LORD|strong="H03068"\w* \w gives|strong="H05414"\w* us \w the land|strong="H00776"\w*.”
\p \v 15 \w Then Rahab let them down|strong="H03381"\w* \w by a rope|strong="H02256"\w* \w through|strong="H01157"\w* \w the window|strong="H02474"\w*, \w since|strong="H03588"\w* \w the house|strong="H01004"\w* \w where she|strong="H01931"\w* \w lived|strong="H03427"\w* \w was built into the wall|strong="H07023"\w* \w of the city|strong="H02346"\w*. \v 16 “\w Go|strong="H01980"\w* \w to the hill country|strong="H02022"\w*,” \w she said|strong="H00559"\w*, “\w so that your pursuers|strong="H07291"\w* \w will not|strong="H06435"\w* \w find|strong="H06293"\w* you. \w Hide yourselves|strong="H02247"\w* \w there|strong="H08033"\w* \w for three|strong="H07969"\w* \w days|strong="H03117"\w* \w until|strong="H05704"\w* \w they|strong="H07291"\w* \w have returned|strong="H07725"\w*; \w then|strong="H00310"\w* \w go|strong="H01980"\w* \w on your way|strong="H01870"\w*.”
\p \v 17 \w The men|strong="H00582"\w* \w said|strong="H00559"\w* \w to her|strong="H00413"\w*, “\w We|strong="H00587"\w* \w will not be bound|strong="H05355"\w* \w by this|strong="H02088"\w* \w oath|strong="H07621"\w* \w you made us swear|strong="H07650"\w* \v 18 \w unless|strong="H02009"\w*, \w when we|strong="H00587"\w* \w enter|strong="H00935"\w* \w the land|strong="H00776"\w*, \w you have tied|strong="H07194"\w* \w this|strong="H02088"\w* \w scarlet|strong="H08144"\w* \w cord|strong="H08615"\w* \w in the window|strong="H02474"\w* \w through which|strong="H00834"\w* \w you let us down|strong="H03381"\w*, \w and unless|strong="H00853"\w* \w you have brought|strong="H00622"\w* \w your father|strong="H00001"\w* \w and|strong="H00853"\w* \w mother|strong="H00517"\w* \w and|strong="H00853"\w* \w brothers|strong="H00251"\w* \w and all|strong="H03605"\w* \w your family|strong="H01004"\w* \w into your house|strong="H01004"\w*. \v 19 \w If anyone|strong="H03605"\w* \w goes out|strong="H03318"\w* \w the door|strong="H01817"\w* \w of your house|strong="H01004"\w* \w into the street|strong="H02351"\w*, \w his blood will be|strong="H01818"\w* \w on his own head|strong="H07218"\w*, \w and we|strong="H00587"\w* \w will be innocent|strong="H05355"\w*. \w But if|strong="H00518"\w* \w a hand|strong="H03027"\w* \w is laid|strong="H01961"\w* on \w anyone|strong="H03605"\w* \w with you|strong="H00854"\w* \w in the house|strong="H01004"\w*, \w his blood|strong="H01818"\w* \w will be on our heads|strong="H07218"\w*. \v 20 \w And if|strong="H00518"\w* \w you report|strong="H05046"\w* \w our mission|strong="H01697"\w*, \w we will be|strong="H01961"\w* \w released|strong="H05355"\w* \w from the oath|strong="H07621"\w* \w you made us swear|strong="H07650"\w*.”
\p \v 21 “\w Let it|strong="H01931"\w* \w be as you say|strong="H01697"\w*,” \w she replied|strong="H00559"\w*, \w and she sent them away|strong="H07971"\w*. \w And when they had gone|strong="H01980"\w*, \w she tied|strong="H07194"\w* \w the scarlet|strong="H08144"\w* \w cord|strong="H08615"\w* \w in the window|strong="H02474"\w*.
\p \v 22 \w So the spies went out|strong="H00935"\w* \w into the hill country|strong="H02022"\w* \w and stayed|strong="H03427"\w* \w there|strong="H08033"\w* \w three|strong="H07969"\w* \w days|strong="H03117"\w*, \w until|strong="H05704"\w* \w their pursuers|strong="H07291"\w* \w had returned|strong="H07725"\w* \w without|strong="H03808"\w* \w finding them|strong="H04672"\w*, \w having searched|strong="H01245"\w* \w all|strong="H03605"\w* \w along the road|strong="H01870"\w*. \v 23 \w Then the two men|strong="H00582"\w* \w started back|strong="H07725"\w*, \w came down|strong="H03381"\w* \w from the hill country|strong="H02022"\w*, \w and crossed the river|strong="H05674"\w*. \w So they came|strong="H00935"\w* \w to|strong="H00413"\w* \w Joshua|strong="H03091"\w* \w son|strong="H01121"\w* \w of Nun|strong="H05126"\w* \w and reported|strong="H05608"\w* \w all|strong="H03605"\w* \w that had happened|strong="H04672"\w* \w to them|strong="H00854"\w*.
\p \v 24 “\w The LORD|strong="H03068"\w* \w has surely|strong="H03588"\w* \w delivered|strong="H05414"\w* \w the entire|strong="H03605"\w* \w land|strong="H00776"\w* \w into our hands|strong="H03027"\w*,” \w they said|strong="H00559"\w* \w to|strong="H00413"\w* \w Joshua|strong="H03091"\w*. “\w Indeed|strong="H01571"\w*, \w all|strong="H03605"\w* \w who dwell|strong="H03427"\w* \w in the land|strong="H00776"\w* \w are melting in fear|strong="H04127"\w* \w of us|strong="H06440"\w*.”
\c 3
\s1 Crossing the Jordan
\p \v 1 \w Early the next morning|strong="H01242"\w* \w Joshua|strong="H03091"\w* \w got up|strong="H07925"\w* \w and left|strong="H05265"\w* \w Shittim|strong="H07851"\w*\f + \fr 3:1 \ft Or \fqa Acacia Grove\f* \w with all|strong="H03605"\w* \w the Israelites|strong="H01121"\w*. \w They went|strong="H00935"\w* \w as|strong="H05704"\w* \w far as the Jordan|strong="H03383"\w*, \w where they camped|strong="H03885"\w* \w before|strong="H02962"\w* \w crossing over|strong="H05674"\w*.
\p \v 2 \w After|strong="H07097"\w* \w three|strong="H07969"\w* \w days|strong="H03117"\w* \w the officers|strong="H07860"\w* \w went|strong="H05674"\w* \w through|strong="H07130"\w* \w the camp|strong="H04264"\w* \v 3 \w and commanded|strong="H06680"\w* \w the people|strong="H05971"\w*: “\w When you see|strong="H07200"\w* \w the ark|strong="H00727"\w* \w of the covenant|strong="H01285"\w* \w of the LORD|strong="H03068"\w* \w your God|strong="H00430"\w* \w being carried|strong="H05375"\w* \w by the Levitical|strong="H03881"\w* \w priests|strong="H03548"\w*, \w you|strong="H00859"\w* \w are to set out|strong="H05265"\w* \w from your positions|strong="H04725"\w* \w and follow|strong="H01980"\w* \w it|strong="H00310"\w*. \v 4 \w But|strong="H00389"\w* \w keep a distance|strong="H07350"\w* \w of about two thousand|strong="H00505"\w* \w cubits|strong="H00520"\w*\f + \fr 3:4 \fqa 2,000 cubits \ft is approximately 3,000 feet or 914.4 meters.\f* \w between yourselves|strong="H00996"\w* \w and the ark|strong="H00996"\w*. \w Do not|strong="H00408"\w* \w go near it|strong="H07126"\w*, \w so that|strong="H04616"\w* \w you can see|strong="H03045"\w* \w the way|strong="H01870"\w* \w to go|strong="H01980"\w*, \w since|strong="H03588"\w* \w you have never|strong="H03808"\w* \w traveled|strong="H05674"\w* \w this way|strong="H01870"\w* \w before|strong="H08543"\w*.”
\p \v 5 \w Then Joshua|strong="H03091"\w* \w told|strong="H00559"\w* \w the people|strong="H05971"\w*, “\w Consecrate yourselves|strong="H06942"\w*, \w for|strong="H03588"\w* \w tomorrow|strong="H04279"\w* \w the LORD|strong="H03068"\w* \w will do|strong="H06213"\w* \w wonders|strong="H06381"\w* \w among you|strong="H07130"\w*.” \v 6 \w And he|strong="H03091"\w* \w said|strong="H00559"\w* \w to|strong="H00413"\w* \w the priests|strong="H03548"\w*, “\w Take|strong="H05375"\w* \w the ark|strong="H00727"\w* \w of the covenant|strong="H01285"\w* \w and go on|strong="H05674"\w* \w ahead of|strong="H06440"\w* \w the people|strong="H05971"\w*.” \w So they carried|strong="H05375"\w* \w the ark|strong="H00727"\w* \w of the covenant|strong="H01285"\w* \w and went|strong="H01980"\w* \w ahead|strong="H06440"\w* \w of them|strong="H05971"\w*.
\p \v 7 \w Now the LORD|strong="H03068"\w* \w said|strong="H00559"\w* \w to|strong="H00413"\w* \w Joshua|strong="H03091"\w*, “\w Today|strong="H03117"\w* \w I will begin|strong="H02490"\w* \w to exalt you|strong="H01431"\w* \w in the sight|strong="H05869"\w* \w of all|strong="H03605"\w* \w Israel|strong="H03478"\w*, \w so|strong="H00834"\w* \w they may know|strong="H03045"\w* \w that|strong="H03588"\w* \w I am|strong="H01961"\w* \w with you|strong="H05973"\w* \w just as|strong="H00834"\w* \w I was|strong="H01961"\w* \w with|strong="H05973"\w* \w Moses|strong="H04872"\w*. \v 8 \w Command|strong="H06680"\w* \w the priests|strong="H03548"\w* \w carrying|strong="H05375"\w* \w the ark|strong="H00727"\w* \w of the covenant|strong="H01285"\w*: ‘\w When you reach|strong="H00935"\w* \w the edge|strong="H07097"\w* \w of the waters|strong="H04325"\w*, \w stand|strong="H05975"\w* \w in the Jordan|strong="H03383"\w*.’”
\p \v 9 \w So Joshua|strong="H03091"\w* \w told|strong="H00559"\w* \w the Israelites|strong="H01121"\w*, “\w Come|strong="H05066"\w* \w here|strong="H02008"\w* \w and listen|strong="H08085"\w* \w to the words|strong="H01697"\w* \w of the LORD|strong="H03068"\w* \w your God|strong="H00430"\w*.” \v 10 \w He|strong="H03091"\w* \w continued|strong="H00559"\w*, “\w This is how|strong="H02063"\w* \w you will know|strong="H03045"\w* \w that|strong="H03588"\w* \w the living|strong="H02416"\w* \w God is|strong="H00410"\w* \w among you|strong="H07130"\w* \w and that He will surely drive out|strong="H03423"\w* \w before you|strong="H06440"\w* \w the Canaanites|strong="H03669"\w*, \w Hittites|strong="H02850"\w*, \w Hivites|strong="H02340"\w*, \w Perizzites|strong="H06522"\w*, \w Girgashites|strong="H01622"\w*, \w Amorites|strong="H00567"\w*, \w and Jebusites|strong="H02983"\w*. \v 11 \w Behold|strong="H02009"\w*, \w the ark|strong="H00727"\w* \w of the covenant|strong="H01285"\w* \w of the Lord|strong="H00136"\w* \w of all|strong="H03605"\w* \w the earth|strong="H00776"\w* \w will go|strong="H05674"\w* \w ahead of you|strong="H06440"\w* \w into the Jordan|strong="H03383"\w*.
\p \v 12 \w Now|strong="H06258"\w* \w choose|strong="H03947"\w* \w twelve|strong="H08147"\w* \w men|strong="H00376"\w* \w from the tribes|strong="H07626"\w* \w of Israel|strong="H03478"\w*, \w one|strong="H00259"\w* \w from each tribe|strong="H07626"\w*. \v 13 \w When the feet|strong="H03709"\w* \w of the priests|strong="H03548"\w* \w who carry|strong="H05375"\w* \w the ark|strong="H00727"\w* \w of the LORD|strong="H03068"\w* — \w the Lord|strong="H00136"\w* \w of all|strong="H03605"\w* \w the earth|strong="H00776"\w* — \w touch down|strong="H05117"\w* \w in the waters|strong="H04325"\w* \w of the Jordan|strong="H03383"\w*, \w its|strong="H03383"\w* \w flowing|strong="H03381"\w* \w waters|strong="H04325"\w* \w will be cut off|strong="H03772"\w* \w and|strong="H04325"\w* \w will stand up|strong="H05975"\w* \w in a|strong="H00259"\w* \w heap|strong="H05067"\w*.”
\p \v 14 \w So|strong="H01961"\w* \w when the people|strong="H05971"\w* \w broke camp|strong="H05265"\w* \w to cross|strong="H05674"\w* \w the Jordan|strong="H03383"\w*, \w the priests|strong="H03548"\w* \w carried|strong="H05375"\w* \w the ark|strong="H00727"\w* \w of the covenant|strong="H01285"\w* \w ahead of|strong="H06440"\w* \w them|strong="H05971"\w*.
\p \v 15 \w Now the Jordan|strong="H03383"\w* \w overflows|strong="H04390"\w* \w its banks|strong="H01415"\w* \w throughout|strong="H03605"\w* \w the harvest|strong="H07105"\w* \w season|strong="H03117"\w*. \w But as soon as the priests|strong="H03548"\w* \w carrying|strong="H05375"\w* \w the ark|strong="H00727"\w* \w reached|strong="H00935"\w* \w the Jordan|strong="H03383"\w* \w and their feet|strong="H07272"\w* \w touched|strong="H02881"\w* \w the water’s|strong="H04325"\w* \w edge|strong="H07097"\w*, \v 16 \w the flowing|strong="H03381"\w* \w water|strong="H04325"\w* \w stood still|strong="H05975"\w*. \w It backed up|strong="H06965"\w* \w as far upstream|strong="H07368"\w* \w as Adam|strong="H00121"\w*, \w a city|strong="H05892"\w* \w in the area|strong="H06654"\w* \w of Zarethan|strong="H06891"\w*, \w while the water flowing|strong="H03381"\w* \w toward|strong="H05921"\w* \w the Sea|strong="H03220"\w* \w of the Arabah|strong="H06160"\w* (\w the Salt Sea|strong="H03220"\w*\f + \fr 3:16 \ft That is, the Dead Sea\f*) \w was completely|strong="H08552"\w* \w cut off|strong="H03772"\w*. \w So the people|strong="H05971"\w* \w crossed over|strong="H05674"\w* \w opposite|strong="H05048"\w* \w Jericho|strong="H03405"\w*. \v 17 \w The priests|strong="H03548"\w* \w carrying|strong="H05375"\w* \w the ark|strong="H00727"\w* \w of the covenant|strong="H01285"\w* \w of the LORD|strong="H03068"\w* \w stood|strong="H05975"\w* \w firm|strong="H03559"\w* \w on dry ground|strong="H02724"\w* \w in the middle|strong="H08432"\w* \w of the Jordan|strong="H03383"\w*, \w while all|strong="H03605"\w* \w Israel|strong="H03478"\w* \w crossed over|strong="H05674"\w* \w the dry ground|strong="H02724"\w*, \w until|strong="H05704"\w* \w the entire|strong="H03605"\w* \w nation|strong="H01471"\w* \w had crossed|strong="H05674"\w* \w the Jordan|strong="H03383"\w*.
\c 4
\s1 Twelve Stones from the Jordan
\p \v 1 \w When|strong="H00834"\w* \w the whole|strong="H03605"\w* \w nation|strong="H01471"\w* \w had finished|strong="H08552"\w* \w crossing|strong="H05674"\w* \w the Jordan|strong="H03383"\w*, \w the LORD|strong="H03068"\w* \w said|strong="H00559"\w* \w to|strong="H00413"\w* \w Joshua|strong="H03091"\w*, \v 2 “\w Choose|strong="H03947"\w* \w twelve|strong="H08147"\w* \w men|strong="H00376"\w* \w from among|strong="H04480"\w* \w the people|strong="H05971"\w*, \w one|strong="H00259"\w* \w from each tribe|strong="H07626"\w*, \v 3 \w and command them|strong="H06680"\w*: ‘\w Take up|strong="H05375"\w* for yourselves \w twelve|strong="H08147"\w* \w stones|strong="H00068"\w* \w from|strong="H02088"\w* \w the middle|strong="H08432"\w* \w of the Jordan|strong="H03383"\w* \w where the priests|strong="H03548"\w* \w were standing|strong="H03559"\w*, \w carry|strong="H05674"\w* \w them|strong="H00853"\w* \w with you|strong="H05973"\w*, \w and set them down|strong="H05117"\w* \w in the place|strong="H04411"\w* \w where|strong="H00834"\w* \w you spend|strong="H03885"\w* \w the night|strong="H03915"\w*.’”
