\p \v 20 \w So when the rams’ horns|strong="H07782"\w* \w sounded|strong="H08628"\w*, \w the people|strong="H05971"\w* \w shouted|strong="H07321"\w*. \w When they|strong="H05971"\w* \w heard|strong="H08085"\w* \w the blast|strong="H06963"\w* \w of the horn|strong="H07782"\w*, \w the people|strong="H05971"\w* \w gave a great|strong="H01419"\w* \w shout|strong="H07321"\w*, \w and the wall|strong="H02346"\w* \w collapsed|strong="H05307"\w*. \w Then all the people|strong="H05971"\w* \w charged|strong="H05927"\w* \w straight|strong="H05048"\w* \w into the city|strong="H05892"\w* \w and captured|strong="H03920"\w* \w it|strong="H05892"\w*. \v 21 \w With the edge|strong="H06310"\w* \w of the sword|strong="H02719"\w* \w they devoted to destruction|strong="H02763"\w* \w everything|strong="H03605"\w* \w in the city|strong="H05892"\w*— \w man|strong="H00376"\w* \w and woman|strong="H00802"\w*, \w young|strong="H05288"\w* \w and|strong="H05704"\w* \w old|strong="H02205"\w*, \w oxen|strong="H07794"\w*, \w sheep|strong="H07716"\w*, \w and donkeys|strong="H02543"\w*.
\p \v 22 \w Meanwhile, Joshua|strong="H03091"\w* \w told|strong="H00559"\w* \w the two|strong="H08147"\w* \w men|strong="H00582"\w* \w who had spied out|strong="H07270"\w* \w the land|strong="H00776"\w*, “\w Go into|strong="H00935"\w* \w the house|strong="H01004"\w* \w of the prostitute|strong="H02181"\w* \w and bring out|strong="H03318"\w* \w the woman|strong="H00802"\w* \w and all|strong="H03605"\w* \w who are|strong="H00834"\w* with her, \w just as|strong="H00834"\w* \w you promised|strong="H07650"\w* her.” \v 23 \w So the young|strong="H05288"\w* \w spies|strong="H07270"\w* \w went in|strong="H00935"\w* \w and brought out|strong="H03318"\w* \w Rahab|strong="H07343"\w*, \w her father|strong="H00001"\w* \w and|strong="H00853"\w* \w mother|strong="H00517"\w* \w and|strong="H00853"\w* \w brothers|strong="H00251"\w*, \w and all|strong="H03605"\w* \w who belonged|strong="H00834"\w* to her. \w They brought out|strong="H03318"\w* \w her whole|strong="H03605"\w* \w family|strong="H04940"\w* \w and settled them|strong="H05117"\w* \w outside|strong="H02351"\w* \w the camp|strong="H04264"\w* \w of Israel|strong="H03478"\w*.
\p \v 24 \w Then the Israelites burned up|strong="H08313"\w* \w the city|strong="H05892"\w* \w and everything|strong="H03605"\w* in it. \w However|strong="H07535"\w*, \w they put|strong="H05414"\w* \w the silver|strong="H03701"\w* \w and gold|strong="H02091"\w* \w and articles|strong="H03627"\w* \w of bronze|strong="H05178"\w* \w and iron|strong="H01270"\w* \w into the treasury|strong="H00214"\w* \w of the LORD’s|strong="H03068"\w* \w house|strong="H01004"\w*. \v 25 \w And|strong="H00853"\w* \w Joshua|strong="H03091"\w* \w spared|strong="H02421"\w* \w Rahab|strong="H07343"\w* \w the prostitute|strong="H02181"\w*, \w with|strong="H00853"\w* \w her father’s|strong="H00001"\w* \w household|strong="H01004"\w* \w and all|strong="H03605"\w* \w who belonged|strong="H00834"\w* to her, \w because|strong="H03588"\w* \w she hid|strong="H02244"\w* \w the men|strong="H04397"\w* \w Joshua|strong="H03091"\w* \w had sent|strong="H07971"\w* \w to spy out|strong="H07270"\w* \w Jericho|strong="H03405"\w*. \w So she has lived|strong="H03427"\w* \w among|strong="H07130"\w* \w the Israelites|strong="H03478"\w* \w to|strong="H05704"\w* \w this|strong="H02088"\w* \w day|strong="H03117"\w*.
\p \v 26 \w At that|strong="H01931"\w* \w time|strong="H06256"\w* \w Joshua|strong="H03091"\w* \w invoked this solemn oath|strong="H07650"\w*:
\b 
\q1 “\w Cursed|strong="H00779"\w* \w before|strong="H06440"\w* \w the LORD|strong="H03068"\w* \w is the man|strong="H00376"\w* \w who|strong="H00834"\w* \w rises up|strong="H06965"\w*
