\li1 \v 33 \w In all|strong="H03605"\w*, \w thirteen|strong="H07969"\w* \w cities|strong="H05892"\w*, \w together with|strong="H05892"\w* \w their pasturelands|strong="H04054"\w*, \w were given to the Gershonite|strong="H01649"\w* \w clans|strong="H04940"\w*.
\p \v 34 \w This is what the Merarite|strong="H04847"\w* \w clan|strong="H04940"\w* (\w the rest of|strong="H03498"\w* \w the Levites) were given|strong="H03881"\w*:
